INSERT INTO "_dic_rock_all" VALUES(110,'MCFBMD','Foid-bearing-micromonzodiorite - A type of microdioritic-rock. In the Rock Classification Scheme, it is the medium-grained equivalent of foid-bearing-monzodiorite. British Geological Survey Research Report RR/99/06, section 5.1.','Foid-bearing-micromonzodiorite','C','R','GRBA','2000-02-24 09:59:59','TMCM','2019-02-22 13:41:23');
INSERT INTO "_dic_rock_all" VALUES(111,'MCFBMG','Foid-bearing-micromonzogabbro - A type of microgabbroic-rock. In the Rock Classification Scheme, it is the medium-grained equivalent of foid-bearing-monzogabbro. British Geological Survey Research Report RR/99/06, section 5.1.','Foid-bearing-micromonzogabbro','C','R','GRBA','2000-02-24 09:59:59','TMCM','2019-02-22 13:41:24');
INSERT INTO "_dic_rock_all" VALUES(112,'MCFBMZ','Foid-bearing-micromonzonite - A type of microsyenitic-rock. In the Rock Classification Scheme, it is the medium-grained equivalent of foid-bearing-monzonite. British Geological Survey Research Report RR/99/06, section 5.1.','Foid-bearing-micromonzonite','C','R','GRBA','2000-02-24 09:59:59','TMCM','2019-02-22 13:41:20');
